Next time, you might want to wish for a blessed figurine of an
*Archon*. They're the highest-level randomly generated monster in the
game, immune to most things (fire/cold/shock/sleep/poison), and don't
wear body armor (too big). They can still wield weapons and wear helms/
shields/gloves/boots, and should start with a shield of reflection.
More details at http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Archon.

